# Engine-contract golden produced by the reference probe: generated by run.sh, do not edit.
# Quest timers: identity, duplicate refusal, one-shot removal before the hook, fixed rate, cancel, no liveness check.
# Format: internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/README.md, "Contract golden format".

table timers.identity
source java/net/sf/l2j/gameserver/scripting/Quest.java 637-669 startQuestTimer
source java/net/sf/l2j/gameserver/scripting/Quest.java 677-755 getQuestTimer cancelQuestTimers
source java/net/sf/l2j/gameserver/scripting/QuestTimer.java 20-111 QuestTimer
provenance probe java=55ff8a4ec7e186d9816cd549246b4cf1f59c9f12 datapack=55ff8a4ec7e186d9816cd549246b4cf1f59c9f12
note Each row runs a fresh script (and a second one, B, where named) on probe NPCs npc1, npc2 and players p1, p2. Lines: every start with its result, then every firing (at is the virtual time since the row began) and every cancel, in order. Timers due at the same time fire in start order (the probe's thread pool; the reference pool does not order ties).
note A timer is keyed by (name, NPC, player) by identity; a null NPC or player is a key of its own, never a wildcard. Scripts keep separate timer sets.
row duplicates
  start A a npc=npc1 player=p1 delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=npc1 player=p1 delay=2000 -> false
  start A a npc=npc2 player=p1 delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=npc1 player=p2 delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=none player=p1 delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=npc1 player=none delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=none player=none delay=1000 -> true
  start A a npc=none player=none delay=1000 -> false
  start A b npc=npc1 player=p1 delay=1000 -> true
  start B a npc=npc1 player=p1 delay=1000 -> true
  start A null npc=none player=none delay=1000 -> false
  fire A a npc=npc1 player=p1 at=1000
  fire A a npc=npc2 player=p1 at=1000
  fire A a npc=npc1 player=p2 at=1000
  fire A a npc=none player=p1 at=1000
  fire A a npc=npc1 player=none at=1000
  fire A a npc=none player=none at=1000
  fire A b npc=npc1 player=p1 at=1000
  fire B a npc=npc1 player=p1 at=1000

